  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Steeper curve (B) is adiabatic<br/>For adiabatic <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>PV</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>=</mo></math> constant</p><p>and curve (A) is isothermal. Therefore,<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant</p></blockquote>",
